{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c6c4b39-cb48-89b3-b235-911ef3274501",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T12:03:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, good afternoon. This is Rui Cabral. I'm calling about a license, a short-term rental license. You'll have to excuse me, I'm hard of hearing, so I talk loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no problem, Mr. Cabral, I can hear you fine. Tell me what you're looking to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I own a house at 272 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. There's an in-law apartment on the back side. I want to rent it out on weekends only. Friday to Sunday, like that. Do I need the short-term rental license for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:01:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you're renting it for short stays, then yes, that's generally the kind of license you'd be looking at. Let me ask a couple of questions. Is the apartment a separate unit with its own entrance and kitchen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Say that again? Its own what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Its own entrance and a kitchen. Is it a separate unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, yes. Separate door on the side, small kitchen. It was my mother's years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And do you live in the main house, or do you rent that out too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent the main part to a tenant. I don't live there. I'm the landlord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. That matters for the application, so you'll want to list yourself as owner and mention the tenant. I can have the application and the requirements sent to you, or you can pick them up at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I'll come in. Now, one thing. Does a licensed contractor have to be the one to apply? Or can I do it myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the owner can apply. A contractor isn't required to submit the application. If any building work is needed to the apartment, that's a separate question, and a contractor might come into it then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No work. It's all ready. Good. What time are you open? I go swim laps early in the morning at the community pool, so I can come after that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open during regular business hours today, and Monday through Friday generally. If you come in after your swim, mid-morning is a fine time. Ask for the zoning counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning counter. Okay. And I bring what with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring your deed information or a tax bill showing you own the property, and a photo ID. They'll tell you if anything else is needed when you get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deed or tax bill, and my ID. Got it. Thank you, Anita."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cabral. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:03:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
